{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Dayan and Aprasatkay Tarphelay</b> — names of nations known among them. And it is possible that Arachay is from ve-Arach, Akkad, and Calneh." "<b>Shoshanchay</b> — from Shushan." "<b>Dehavay</b> — from Elam."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:50.308267248Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}